    {
      "id": "claim_1b8b4972520345a5a718166acec4f6b5",
      "statement": "The DVC pipeline declares six stages (validate, prepare_data, train, simulate_drift, detect_drift, score_impact), each run via `uv run python -m ...`. Artifact dependencies are: prepare_data produces reference.parquet and production_base.parquet; train consumes reference.parquet and produces baseline.joblib plus baseline_metrics.json; simulate_drift produces production_drift.parquet from production_base.parquet; detect_drift consumes all three parquet files; score_impact consumes production, drifted data, the model and the metrics file. The validate stage has no outputs.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://dvc.lock#L1-L171",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8e42027ce821604796db6abb78e8e6e5c222fb4a1ece832c179e3501b3dee969:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://dvc.yaml#L1-L72",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8b116b88e4916576f209b1269418ecc7459978421e99781b45e39e955ddbfdd1:"
        }
