      "statement": "Small JSON metrics and report outputs (models/baseline_metrics.json, reports/drift_baseline.json, reports/drift_simulated.json, reports/drift_alerts.json, reports/score_impact.json) are declared with `cache: false` in dvc.yaml, while parquet files, baseline.joblib and HTML drift reports use default DVC caching.",
