      "id": "claim_dbad8a7376404edb8db7ebc17184ac0f",
      "statement": "prepare_data loads only the required raw columns, validates the batch with the lazy Pandera training contract before writing anything (a violation raises SchemaErrors and leaves no output), then makes a target-stratified 70/30 reference/production split seeded by settings.random_seed and persists raw (not feature-engineered) columns as Parquet in data/processed.",
