    {
      "id": "claim_0e2a51de8a524643a529401c92ec7236",
      "statement": "train() fits the baseline on an 80% stratified split of the reference data and evaluates on the 20% hold-out, computing auc, ks, pr_auc, f1 and a decision threshold chosen to maximise F1, plus per-gender and per-age-band AUC fairness metrics that skip groups with fewer than 30 positives or a single class.",
      "evidence": [
