    {
      "id": "claim_d5b9a01a8d5e4b6b95f244cbfb6d39f0",
      "statement": "train.main re-validates reference.parquet, then within an MLflow run named baseline-xgboost under experiment credit-scoring-baseline (tracking URI from settings.mlflow_tracking_uri) logs XGB_PARAMS and n_rows as params, overall and fairness metrics, and the pipeline via mlflow.sklearn.log_model with cloudpickle; it also calls save_model so the joblib model and metrics JSON consumed by DVC are written. baseline_metrics.json holds only the five overall metrics, not the fairness metrics.",
